<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Goto<STYLE ID="1">'s eyes, turned on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, filled with suspicion all at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... what do you mean..."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> died when you, <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, were 10, and the first of the curse-killings happened when you were 11. 
{PAUSE ""}
So back in elementary school, <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, you were actively involved in solving the case?
{PAUSE ""}
　Do adults in Arata tell children the details of murder cases?
{PAUSE ""}
　I don't know Arata's culture, but normally you wouldn't tell a child the details of a case, would you?
{PAUSE ""}
　Who was killed when, where, with what weapon, and how, and so on."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="1">'s point was clear to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But how did she mean to settle this contradiction?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Surely not that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... the thing is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sorry, the part about having heard it since the incidents first happened was a lie."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"For someone asking our advice, you open with a lie?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="4">, don't come down on her like that. There's gotta be some reason it's hard to say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... I heard it from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. This past New Year's, all of it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"From </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... this past New Year's, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I had a huge fight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けんか">Hearing what the fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was about, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> secretly told me everything."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, I've formed three hypotheses. 
{PAUSE ""}
One: the case where <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is the culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
Two: the case where <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> simply misunderstood something. 
{PAUSE ""}
Three... 
{PAUSE ""}
the case where <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> worked out who the culprit was on her own. 
{PAUSE ""}
And the culprit is someone very close, so close she wouldn't want to tell anyone..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... that's...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> fell silent before </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">'s reasoning, which you could almost call an interrogation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But after heaving a big sigh, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm... you're not called a genius girl </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だて">for nothing</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">All right. I'll tell you what I heard from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and what we talked about."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―From here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> began to tell us the conclusion she had reached with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
